{"seq":1,"slug":"painting","title":"绘画艺术","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/core-contributions/painting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"revolutionizing-painting","title":"革新绘画艺术","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/core-contributions/painting/revolutionizing-painting","wordCount":1592,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"sfumato-and-technique","title":"晕涂法与绘画技法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/core-contributions/painting/sfumato-and-technique","wordCount":1551,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"绘画艺术\">绘画艺术</h1><p>达·芬奇最辉煌的贡献，首先体现在他对绘画艺术的彻底革新。本章考察其绘画成就。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;革新绘画艺术&quot;——他如何把绘画提升为融合科学、心理与诗意的至高艺术。第二篇文档讲述&quot;晕涂法与绘画技法&quot;,剖析支撑其杰作的精湛技法及背后的科学精神。</p>\n"}